msgid "It begins by calling the basic flow. The first step is a call into , the basic ingestion flow every asset takes: the upload is accepted, its metadata goes into the knowledge graph, and the asset is catalogued in . That flow makes no content-type decision; everything after the call is the document-specific refinement (placement PR6)."
